WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.212
The reason this matters is energy.

00:00:02.292 --> 00:00:07.134
Physical neural systems, whether biological brains
or neuromorphic chips,

00:00:07.214 --> 00:00:12.460
could train networks at a tiny fraction of the
energy cost of digital hardware.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.966
But backpropagation, the workhorse of deep learning,

00:00:16.046 --> 00:00:21.696
needs a separate linear backward pass and the exact
transpose of every weight matrix,

00:00:21.776 --> 00:00:25.404
neither of which physical substrates provide naturally.

00:00:25.484 --> 00:00:30.393
EP sidesteps this, yet its own symmetry assumption
is nearly as demanding.

00:00:30.473 --> 00:00:36.191
And there was a warning sign: the asymmetric
version of EP had only ever worked on toy

00:00:36.271 --> 00:00:39.495
tasks like MNIST and outright failed on CIFAR-10.

00:00:39.575 --> 00:00:41.180
Nobody had explained why.
